# 5. Refresh the Power BI Dashboard

Once the input files have been placed in the correct folder:

1. Open the Power BI dashboard file.
2. Trigger a **data refresh**.
3. Wait for the refresh to complete successfully.
4. Check that no refresh or data-loading errors are displayed.

The refresh will update the dashboard using the input files downloaded from Data IQ during the morning run.

